# anthropic_service_account (Data Source)

Fetches a single Workload Identity Federation (WIF) service account by ID (beta). A service account is a named, non-human identity that federation rules target.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/service_accounts/{id}`.
> **Auth**: org:admin OAuth bearer token (`auth_token` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`). Admin API keys are not accepted on this endpoint.
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

